Update content:
1. Add legendary player trial function;
2. Time limited team building challenge - legendary trial;
3. Fix the issue of two Messi players being able to play simultaneously;
4. Add Red Gold Coach - Conte;
5. Add a "synthesis" entry at the bottom left of the legendary player list, and when the fragments are enough to synthesize the entire card player, there will be a corresponding red dot prompt.
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43302601/0f39e9d6e629b09dd3eb923d4bd2291ef4b243ae.jpg[/img]

Dear managers:

We will update and maintain the game at the following time,

During the maintenance period, all managers are requested to quit the game to avoid unnecessary losses.

We apologize for the inconvenience caused to all managers.

Please continue to support "Soccer Clubs Football Manager" in the future.

[b]Maintenance time:[/b]
0:00 on February 7, 2023

[b]Maintenance content[/b]
1. Fix the problem that turning off the game sound in the settings and restarting the game is invalid;
2. Fix the problem that after the acceleration of the setting interface, the game is invalid after restarting;
3. Modify the problem that the pop-up window of the second season is displayed every time you log in;
4. Modify the problem of partial loading exception;
5. Fix Messi model abnormalities and other issues.

[h2][b]World service universal welfare[/b][/h2]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43302601/df4a75d4382b180b6ab0ffa4199df6c43d05250e.png[/img]

[h3]How to participate in welfare activities:[/h3]
Enter any [Qatar Theater] server to create a character to participate, let's take a look at the benefits of the whole people~

[h3]1. You can choose a gold star player when you log in! [/h3]
Sign in on the first day, and get a powerful flash gold star for free! Log in on the 7th to receive exclusive sign-in benefits for the world server;
Participation conditions: All club chairmen in the world server (Qatar theater);
Event time: within 14 days of the world server (Qatar theater) where the club presidents are located.

[h3] 2. The first monthly card and the supreme monthly card are activated for free! [/h3]
Log in to activate the privileges of the first monthly card and the supreme monthly card for free on the monthly card interface;
Activity time: within 14 days of the server opening in the world server (Qatar theater);
*Activation of big and small monthly cards can only be done during the event time;
*The monthly card and supreme monthly card last for 30 days.

[h3] 3. The strongest in history! Reduced privileges! [/h3]
Players in the Qatar theater enjoy exclusive privileges such as [Dungeon Level Quick Match] [Mainline Skip Game] and other burden reduction privileges;
Participation conditions: all chairmen in the world server (Qatar theater);
Activity time: enjoy permanently in the world server (Qatar theater).

[h3]4. Choose your own forward star at the start! [/h3]
At the beginning of the game, you can choose the forward flash gold, and directly form the top lineup of the version;
Participation conditions: in the world server (Qatar theater), chairpersons with a level ≥ 15;
Event time: The chairpersons can choose their own stars within 14 days of the server's opening in the world server (Qatar theater).

[h3]5. Gold star upgrade gift package! Log in every day to get it for free! [/h3]
Create a special development gift package for the flash gold stars to speed up the upgrade, and the core stars can easily be full of stars! Log in and log in within 7 days to receive the gold star upgrade gift package for free;
Participation conditions: All club chairmen in the world server (Qatar theater);
Activity time: within 14 days of the server opening in the world server (Qatar theater);
*Glittering gold star upgrade spree! The duration is 14 days.

